WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:03.135
-Jason, since you play Aquaman,
I wanted to challenge you

00:00:03.135 --> 00:00:04.470
to a "water war."

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:06.472
We'll play the card game war,
but if you lose the hand,

00:00:06.472 --> 00:00:08.041
you get a --
[ Laughter ]

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:11.277
You get a pint of water
in the face, okay?

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:12.778
We have five glasses of water.

00:00:12.778 --> 00:00:15.014
The first one to throw all five
glasses on their opponent wins

00:00:15.014 --> 00:00:18.117
and gets to water-cannon
the loser.

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:20.686
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:20.686 --> 00:00:23.356
Lots of ways to get wet,
but only one way to win.

00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:26.025
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.025 --> 00:00:28.194
-You love it.
-I know, I know.

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:30.330
-There's only one way to win!

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:31.364
-All right.
Are you ready for this?

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:33.132
-I'm ready.
-Do you trust the cards?

00:00:33.132 --> 00:00:34.634
Do you want to shuffle?
Are you all good?

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:36.336
Do you trust me?
-I trust you.

00:00:36.336 --> 00:00:38.170
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:40.973
-One, two --
-Oh, hold on, hold on.

00:00:40.973 --> 00:00:43.109
Hold on, hold on, hang on,
hang on, hang on.

00:00:43.109 --> 00:00:44.677
Let's just do it.
Ready?

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:46.846
-One, two, three, flip.

00:00:46.846 --> 00:00:48.615
-Ah!
-I won.

00:00:48.615 --> 00:00:52.251
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.251 --> 00:00:56.322
Now I'm not sure
if I wanted to win.

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:58.191
Do you want to win?

00:00:58.191 --> 00:01:02.762
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:04.263
-Wore my hat, Jimmy.

00:01:04.263 --> 00:01:06.366
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:09.068 --> 00:01:14.039
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:14.039 --> 00:01:15.441
-All right, all right.

00:01:15.441 --> 00:01:19.044
Roots, I'm going to run out
of here if things get nasty.

00:01:19.044 --> 00:01:21.514
One, two, three, play.

00:01:21.514 --> 00:01:23.249
-Oh.

00:01:23.249 --> 00:01:27.286
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.286 --> 00:01:29.322
-Dude, it's great having
you on the show.

00:01:29.322 --> 00:01:30.589
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.589 --> 00:01:33.092
I love "Frontier,"
it's fantastic.

00:01:33.092 --> 00:01:35.528
I like the beginning --
I also like the end is great.

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:37.363
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.363 --> 00:01:40.165
[ Applause ]

00:01:40.165 --> 00:01:43.169
One, two, three, flip.

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:44.871
Oh, my gosh.

00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:47.574
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.574 --> 00:01:50.343
-I think this is like
Aquaman loves water?

00:01:50.343 --> 00:01:52.645
-I don't know what's going on.
It's not rigged.

00:01:52.645 --> 00:01:54.413
I'm so sorry to do this to you.

00:01:54.413 --> 00:01:56.582
-It better not be rigged, Jimmy.
-I swear.

00:01:56.582 --> 00:01:58.184
I swear, it's not, right?

00:01:58.184 --> 00:01:59.818
If it was, I had nothing
to do with it.

00:01:59.818 --> 00:02:01.253
There is a writer that's
running around the hall --

00:02:01.253 --> 00:02:03.723
-Throw it in my face!
-All right, yeah, yes, sir!

00:02:03.723 --> 00:02:04.958
-Now!
-Yes, sir!

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:06.692
-Again!
-Yes, okay!

00:02:06.692 --> 00:02:10.596
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:10.596 --> 00:02:14.033
One, two, three, flip.

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:17.737
-Okay.
I'm good with this.

00:02:17.737 --> 00:02:19.606
I'm good with this.
-Sorry, sorry, sorry.

00:02:19.606 --> 00:02:27.246
[ Applause ]

00:02:27.246 --> 00:02:28.748
Come on!

00:02:28.748 --> 00:02:33.452
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.452 --> 00:02:34.854
I don't want to get
your suit wet.

00:02:34.854 --> 00:02:36.956
-Yeah.

00:02:36.956 --> 00:02:38.624
Well, okay.
Just a little sticky down there.

00:02:38.624 --> 00:02:40.326
Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:42.962
One, two, three.

00:02:42.962 --> 00:02:44.296
Oh, yeah.

00:02:44.296 --> 00:02:46.466
-That was like --
I mean, that was like --

00:02:46.466 --> 00:02:51.370
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:52.905
-Go ahead, go ahead.

00:02:52.905 --> 00:03:02.782
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:02.782 --> 00:03:05.885
-Here we go!
-Oh, I would have won that one.

00:03:05.885 --> 00:03:07.520
-Oh, trust me, I know
what it feels like.

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:09.922
Yeah.
Yeah, no, trust me.

00:03:09.922 --> 00:03:11.623
-There it is.
-For the win!

00:03:11.623 --> 00:03:14.093
One, two, three, come on.

00:03:14.093 --> 00:03:16.129
Oh.

00:03:16.129 --> 00:03:17.196
-Aah!

00:03:17.196 --> 00:03:20.333
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:20.333 --> 00:03:24.270
There we go.

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:26.406
