in your glass?

00:03:26.406 --> 00:03:29.842
[ Laughter ]

00:03:29.842 --> 00:03:33.045
I got basically slapped
in the face

00:03:33.045 --> 00:03:35.581
with water just there.

00:03:35.581 --> 00:03:37.883
-It's a talent.
You gonna kick my ass?

00:03:37.883 --> 00:03:39.585
Oh [ Bleep ].

00:03:39.585 --> 00:03:43.622
[ Cheers ]

00:03:43.622 --> 00:03:45.958
Oh!
It's the last one, man.

00:03:45.958 --> 00:03:47.626
[ Cheers ]

00:03:47.626 --> 00:03:50.129
-One, two, three!

00:03:50.129 --> 00:03:52.832
Flip!
What?!

00:03:52.832 --> 00:03:56.836
-Boom!
Boom!

00:03:56.836 --> 00:04:00.006
[ Band plays ]

00:04:00.006 --> 00:04:08.848
[ Laughter ]

00:04:08.848 --> 00:04:13.152
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:13.152 --> 00:04:18.824
[ Laughter ]

00:04:18.824 --> 00:04:22.428
-That went up --
That one went up my nose.

00:04:22.428 --> 00:04:25.064
That one went up
my nose right there.

00:04:25.064 --> 00:04:26.232
All right.
Here we go.

00:04:26.232 --> 00:04:30.903
-All right.
-One, two, three.

00:04:30.903 --> 00:04:32.438
I hate you!
-Yes!

00:04:32.438 --> 00:04:35.875
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:35.875 --> 00:04:38.577
Boom!

00:04:38.577 --> 00:04:41.313
Bam!

00:04:41.313 --> 00:04:43.382
There we are, baby!

00:04:43.382 --> 00:04:47.086
