00:04:47.086 --> 00:04:48.954
Here we are.
Here we are.

00:04:48.954 --> 00:04:51.123
Hey, this is amazing.
-This is for the win.

00:04:51.123 --> 00:04:52.458
I love you, buddy.
-I love you, too.

00:04:52.458 --> 00:04:55.294
Let's do this.
-One, two, three!

00:04:55.294 --> 00:04:58.330
Oh!

00:04:58.330 --> 00:05:00.432
No, you know what that means?
-This is amazing!

00:05:00.432 --> 00:05:03.169
That means, take out
your pitcher.

00:05:03.169 --> 00:05:05.170
You got a pitcher down there.

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:07.639
Now, pick three,
and when we flip over that,

00:05:07.639 --> 00:05:09.442
