00:05:19.752 --> 00:05:21.654
-Oh, Jimmy.
-This is war, baby!

00:05:21.654 --> 00:05:23.588
-No matter what happens,
I love you.

00:05:23.588 --> 00:05:24.924
-I love you too, man.

00:05:24.924 --> 00:05:26.292
-Bam!

00:05:26.292 --> 00:05:27.626
Oh, my God!

00:05:27.626 --> 00:05:29.395
Double [ Bleep ] War!

00:05:29.395 --> 00:05:31.697
