00:05:31.697 --> 00:05:33.132
Has there ever been
a double war?

00:05:33.132 --> 00:05:34.166
-There's never been
a double war!

00:05:34.166 --> 00:05:36.536
-There's never been
a double war!

00:05:36.536 --> 00:05:38.003
-You can't do that.
-Yes!

00:05:38.003 --> 00:05:39.005
-All right.
-Now what happens?

00:05:39.005 --> 00:05:40.640
-We have to do it again.
One, two, three.

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:46.712
-All right, okay.
-One, two -- three --

00:05:46.712 --> 00:05:49.515
